OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain quickly
OL,6,Fspreading north-eastwards this evening
OL,7,Fand becoming persistent for a time
OL,8,Fovernight across much of the region.
OL,9,FThe rain will be heavy at times and
OL,10,Faccompanied by a strengthening breeze,
OL,11,Fparticularly along the south coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FCloudy with overnight rain
OL,14,Fclearing just after dawn. Blustery,
OL,15,Fand at times heavy, showers follow
OL,16,Fwith a risk of hail and thunder.
OL,17,FMilder but tempered by the fresh winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
