OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FChangeable on Wednesday and Thursday
OL,7,Fwith scattered heavy showers and some
OL,8,Fbright or sunny intervals. Showers
OL,9,Fclearing later on Friday. Temperatures
OL,10,Fnear normal for the time of year.
